    "title": "Principal Plant Manager at RINL South Asia Partners",
    "description": "RINL South Asia Partners invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Plant Manager at our Meerut location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout RINL South Asia Partners:\nRINL South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Implement 5S, Kaizen, and Six Sigma practices on the shop floor\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in SolidWorks\n• Proficiency in ISO 9001\n• Proficiency in Statistical Process Control\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n• Proficiency in TPM\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Meerut, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with RINL South Asia Partners!",
